    "title": "Floyd County Supervisors Hear Plea for Food Bank Funding - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mark Pitz ,\n12 hours ago Floyd County has been asked for $25,000 to support new facilities for the Northeast Iowa Food Bank (NEIFB), based in Waterloo. That’s NEIFB Director Barb Prather addressing Floyd County Supervisors recently about their campaign seeking funding assistance from each of the 16 counties in its district, which includes Floyd County (as well as Chickasaw, Mitchell, Butler, Howard, Franklin, Fayette, and Winneshiek counties). Read full article",
